  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\WelcomePageBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kātahi ka whaiaro ake tō pūrere. Poroakitia te tāurunga whīwhiwhi o te kupuhipa, ka whakamahi i te Windows Hello ki te wetemaukati i tō pūrere, te manatoko i tō tuakiri, me te hoko taonga i te Store mā te whakamahi i ō karu.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\WelcomePageBeta\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: PETA
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\TutorialPageInstruction\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Puritia tō waea ki mua i ō karu, ka tīpako Panuku kia haere tonu.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\PinRequiredPageBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hangaia he PIN hei whakamahi mehemea kāore āhukahuka karu i te wātea. E kore pea koe e hiahia ki taua mea, engari ka noho hei tārua ki te tūpono ka hiahiatia.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\PinRequiredPageBodyTwo\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kia tatū koe i tō PIN, ka āhei koe te takiuru mai mā ō karu.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\OrientationErrorPageHeader\Text:
